#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice/scripts.inc:25
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice_Text_NoSuccessFindingScanner"
msgid ""
"I'm investigating this ship on behalf\n"
"of CAPT. STERN.\p"
"He also asked me to find a SCANNER,\n"
"but I haven't had any success…$"
msgstr ""
"我正在代替楠木船长调查这艘船。\p"
"他还拜托我找一台探测器，\n"
"可是我一直没找到……$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice_Text_OhCanYouDeliverScanner"
msgid ""
"Oh! That's a SCANNER!\p"
"Listen, can I get you to deliver that\n"
"to CAPT. STERN?\p"
"I want to investigate this ship a\n"
"little more.$"
msgstr ""
"哦！那是探测器！\p"
"听我说，能请你把它交给楠木船长吗？\p"
"我想再调查一下这艘船。$"

#: data/maps/AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice/scripts.inc:38
msgctxt "AbandonedShip_CaptainsOffice_Text_ThisIsSSCactus"
msgid ""
"This ship is called S.S. CACTUS.\n"
"It seems to be from an earlier era.$"
msgstr ""
"这艘船叫做仙人掌号。\n"
"好像是很久以前的船。$"
